  "content": "```html\n<html><body>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MIqTqet.png\" width=\"542\" height=\"194\"><br><br></strong><strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKingybu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4fnAZgM.png\" width=\"331\" height=\"34\"></a><br></strong></strong><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\">厌倦了 Minecraft 的基本用户界面？</strong></strong></p> \n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hM7UhuRFaa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lvIL7aA.png\" width=\"185\" height=\"37\"></a></strong></strong></p> \n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kingybu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cqteEYQ.png\" width=\"202\" height=\"39\"></a></strong></strong></p> \n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fkingybusiness%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2b2cGRW.png\" width=\"187\" height=\"30\"></a></strong></p> \n<p><strong>讨厌每次打开附魔台时都面对与工作台一样的灰色菜单了吗？想让游戏增添一些色彩吗？引入彩色容器，现已支持深色模式！</strong></p> \n<p><strong>一个旨在匹配所有可交互方块颜色的模组 GUI 替换包。<br>除了视觉效果外，该材质包会取代工作台、熔炉等方块的 GUI。每个新设计都取自其对应方块的灵感。有些甚至是动画的！<br></strong></p> \n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/optigui\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QhUZf5G.png\" width=\"413\" height=\"30\"></a><br></strong>or <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/572we2z.png\"></a><br></strong></p> \n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Crafting Table&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Ender Chest&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Anvil &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p> \n<div class=\"spoiler\"> \n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CZBBaAo.png\"></p> \n</div> \n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><strong>请阅读此内容！</strong></p> \n<div class=\"spoiler\"> \n<p>If you are <strong>使用 OptiGUI 或 Optifine</strong>, 请使用任何修改版语言以防止错误<br><br>If you are <strong>未使用 OptiGUI 或 Optifine</strong>, 请使用原版语言以正常显示箱子和其他纹理!<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VffXUn6.png\"></p> \n</div> \n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/syZkvjR.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"27\"><br>-配方书<br>- 铁砧<br>- 高炉<br>- 酿造站<br>- 制图台<br>- 合成器<br>- 箱子（大，小，末地）<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KpcLE4g.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\"></strong><br>- 工作台<br>- 发射器<br>- 发射器<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KpcLE4g.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\"></strong><br>- 附魔台<br>- 熔炉<br>- 研磨器<br>- 漏斗<br>- 织布机<br>- 潜影盒（所有颜色）<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KpcLE4g.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\"></strong><br>- 烟熏炉<br>- 石材切割机<br>- 锻造台<br>- 桶<br>- 村民职业<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KpcLE4g.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\"></strong><br>- 信标&nbsp;</p> \n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>包括</strong><br>- 深色加载界面 <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MD7GkQB.png\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\"></strong><br>- 深色成就菜单<br>-生存库存&nbsp;<br></span></p> \n<p><span style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RtheOPo.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"31\"></span></p> \n<div class=\"spoiler\"> \n<p><span style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">为什么一些纹理不生效？</span><br></strong>请确保已安装 <strong>Optifine</strong> 或 <strong>OptiGUI and Animatica</strong>. 某些纹理（如矿车和船箱 GUI）仅因 Optifine 的限制而与 OptiGUI 兼容.<br>我强烈建议使用 <strong>OptiGUI</strong> 和 <strong>Animatica</strong> 替代 Optifine!<br><br><strong>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">能否把我的素材包加入我的模组包？</span><br>可以</strong>, 只要在您的 Modrinth 或 Curseforge 模组包中正确署名并添加我对依赖项的支持即可.<strong><br></strong></span></p> \n<p><span style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">哪里可以提交关于模组支持或其他内容的建议？</span><br></strong>您可以在<strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hM7UhuRFaa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">discord</a>!</strong></span></p> \n<p><span style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">运行不正常或有问题怎么办？</span><br></strong>您可以寻求您猜到的帮助，当然还是那个<strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hM7UhuRFaa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">discord</a>!</strong></span></p> \n</div> \n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iabKPjs.png\" width=\"323\" height=\"33\"><br>- 船形箱子 <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PLg8xaL.png\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\"></strong><br>- 木船 <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PLg8xaL.png\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\"></strong></p> \n<p><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vu4XFTD.png\" width=\"261\" height=\"36\"><br></strong></strong><span style=\"text-align:center\">- 创造模式库存</span><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><br></strong></strong><span style=\"text-align:center\">- 模组支持</span></p> \n<p><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dUMzdKH.png\" width=\"113\" height=\"26\"><br></strong></strong><strong>Chris_XENO<br></strong><strong>BurntToast_<br></strong><strong>Kingybu</strong></p> \n<p><em>特别感谢：</em><strong><em><br></em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shrimpsnail/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shrimpsnail</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fBeagleNF4O4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BeagleNF404</a><br>支持者 :)</strong></p> \n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oklbCS0.png\" width=\"116\" height=\"32\"><br>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftiktok.com%252f%2540demonjoetv%252fvideo%252f7344793939091803434\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5upkBgn.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"215\"></a><br>&nbsp;@<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftiktok.com%252f%2540demonjoetv%252fvideo%252f7344793939091803434\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">demonjoetv</a><br></strong></p> \n<div class=\"spoiler\"> \n<p><a style=\"color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftiktok.com%252f%2540shockbyte%252fvideo%252f7379275001075125505\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zL9qMJv.png\" width=\"122\" height=\"216\"></a><br>&nbsp;@<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftiktok.com%252f%2540shockbyte%252fvideo%252f7379275001075125505\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">shockbyte</a></p> \n</div> \n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p> \n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/941/more-by-me.png\" alt=\"more by me.png\" width=\"466\" height=\"48\"></strong></p> \n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/colourful-containers-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/939/pack2.png\" alt=\"pack2.png\" width=\"98\" height=\"98\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/brewing-guide\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/938/pack1.png\" alt=\"pack1.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></strong></a><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/kingybus-hud-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/940/pack4.png\" alt=\"pack4.png\" width=\"113\" height=\"113\"></a><br></strong></p> \n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p> \n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p> \n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fkingybu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/1ae62cc0-f2ab-4597-88a2-f1c45b3b49ae.webp\" width=\"754\" height=\"125\"></strong></a></p> \n<p>&nbsp;</p> \n<p>&nbsp;</p> \n<p>&nbsp;</p> \n</body></html>\n```",
